+    // LeanAID fix F-12 (not in oref0): with max_basal or max_daily_basal missing or not a
+    // number, maxSafeBasal is NaN and no rate cap applies. Then refuse to raise the rate, in
+    // the form of the CGM-error branch below: no microbolus, cancel a temp above the
